## Theme and Storyline

**Theme:**

Surviving Dracula: A text-based Gothic Horror Survival Game

**Storyline:**

The game takes place inside a treacherous, haunted castle known as Dracula's 
Lair. The player suddenly gains consciousness and realizes they've been kidnapped 
and are in the Grand Entrance Hall of Dracula's dreaded castle. The player must locate 
and collect six hidden protective artifacts: the Sacred Bread, Garlic, Mirror, Cross, 
Holy Water, and a Torch safely before Dracula finds them and they becomes his next 
victim. Dracula lies in wait within the castle's Conservatory room waiting to make the 
player his dinner. The player must successfully secure all six defensive items before 
crossing the threshold into the Conservatory. Doing so without all six items will result 
in the player being overpowered by Dracula and becoming Dracula's dinner. Game over.   

## Rooms

Project One requires a minimum of eight rooms.

1. Grand Entrance Hall: Start room
2. Dining Hall 
3. Kitchen
4. Bedchamber
5. Crypt
6. Ruined Chapel
7. Tower
8. Conservatory: Villain room

## Items

With the minimum eight-room design, Project One requires at least six items.
Every room except the start room and villain room must contain one item.

1. Sacred Bread
2. Garlic
3. Mirror
4. Cross
5. Holy Water
6. Torch

## Villain

Count Dracula is an ancient, bloodthirsty vampire whose sole motivation is to make the 
kidnapped player his next victim. Dracula possesses sharp fangs, a terrifying hypnotic 
gaze, and deadly superhuman strength. Only possessing all six of the protective artifacts 
together can defeat him. 

